<http://data.silknow.org/object/8a7d8e75-4719-3cc3-b404-ef7a2da5fb92>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Set of two narrow and two wide bed curtains. Polychrome wool yarns embroidered on linen warp and cotton weft ground, woven in weft-faced twill (fustian). Branches with large leaves and flowers. Hilly landscape below with hunter and dog pursuing deer. Same design as sets in Historic Deerfield and Cooper-Hewitt Museum. Ground repaired in several areas. Matching valance is 61.1031."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/a6b9448f-bb89-3028-b4b7-a9723a1edabf> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Set of two narrow and two wide bed curtains. Polychrome wool yarns embroidered on linen warp and cotton weft ground, woven in weft-faced twill (fustian). Branches with large leaves and flowers. Hilly landscape below with hunter and dog pursuing deer. Same design as sets in Historic Deerfield and Cooper-Hewitt Museum. Ground repaired in several areas. Matching valance is 61.1031."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/8a7d8e75-4719-3cc3-b404-ef7a2da5fb92/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/8a7d8e75-4719-3cc3-b404-ef7a2da5fb92/dimension/1> ;
